"updatedate":"2005-10-07 10:44:26","updater":"nVIR","backup_location":"ia903600_10"},"reviews":[{"reviewbody":"This, along with several of these films, is listed as being in colour when it is actually in black and white.","reviewtitle":"Black and white","reviewer":"boffy_b","reviewdate":"2008-01-19 16:36:38","createdate":"2008-01-19 16:36:38","stars":"0"},{"reviewbody":"oddball film that is, I guess, a recruitment film for the English army. Where else can you mix wartime maneuvers with hot babes and polo? Fun oddball film.","reviewtitle":"Word!","reviewer":"Spuzz","reviewdate":"2008-06-06 21:47:57","createdate":"2008-06-06 21:47:57","stars":"4"},{"reviewbody":"Recruiting film visits the Suez Canal with side trips to the local market place with native women in white burkas and British Army women in crisp uniforms.  We see men playing polo and racing motorcycles, as well as German shepherds being trained for battle.  Later, there is action on the road, looking for contraband and a gun battle in the jungle region, where one man is shot through his lower leg and bandaged.\nThe male narrator is veddy British and the music score full of upbeat military tunes.","reviewtitle":"1950 B/W British Army short subject","reviewer":"PDGazette2","reviewdate":"2016-10-25 20:42:57","createdate":"2016-10-25 20:42:57","stars":"3"},{"reviewbody":"Hello,\n\nI am working on a low-budget documentary.\nand I would be honored to use clips from you video\n\ncan you please confirm that I can copy, modify, distribute and perform the work your video and video is free of known restrictions under copyright law?\n\nWhat would be the best way to contact?\n\nThank you very much and I really appreciate your help","reviewtitle":"Can I use clips of this video?","reviewer":"M Kareem Awadalla","reviewer_itemname":"@m_kareem_awadalla","reviewdate":"2018-05-25 21:14:25","createdate":"2018-05-25 21:14:25","stars":"5"}],"server":"dn800300.us.archive.org","simplelists":{"solo_manifest":{"solo_manifest_dn800300":{"sys_changed_by":{"source":"task","task_id":"5421021477"},"sys_last_changed":"2026-06-06 09:42:54.931537"}}},"solo":true,"uniq":1552269987,"workable_servers":["dn800300.us.archive.org"]}